    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31428" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσκωμάζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burst in like a party of
				revellers</i>: generally, <i>burst in upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
