					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					51(27).30
				</span></i>
