				Lyc.
				1355
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσεκώμασεν ὁ
			ἄργυρος</span> silver <i>came romping in,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.231e
			</span></i>.</div>
